      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should probably go in a new suite/file. Hard Reset isn\u0027t a control message, and this test is unlike the others in this suite, except that `test_verify_bist_tx_test_data` sends a control message incidentally.",
      "revId": "f03d55c5d52c56dc71fc40ade579a8ff3e3d4f41",
